On Friday, May 9, 2014 6:04:00 PM UTC+1, Richard McElreath wrote:
> On Friday, May 9, 2014 2:23:23 AM UTC-7, Bob Carpenter wrote:
> >
> > On May 8, 2014, at 12:11 PM, vera <kandasa...@gmail.com> wrote:
