Subject: Re: How to marginalize latent variable z in supervised LDA?
Message-ID: <-hh1XHUb7XI.gidGcojy4s4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-hh1XHUb7XI.nlAB5E4tmG8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
