Your problems are in the line above, which has several problems.

1.  It needs a semicolon at the end.

2.  phi is an array of vectors, and only vectors can be transposed;  you
    need to work on an element of phi.

I'd suggest taking a look at the manual chapter on arrays
vs. vectors.

There's probably an easier way to write what you want
in terms of the linear algebra without creating an expensive
intermediate identity matrix.

- Bob

